Anime Ultrascale
A Tool for Extreme Anime Upscaling.

--------------------------------------------------

This program requires Python of version >= 3.10
to be installed, and the python package 'venv' to
be installed in it.

The program also requires the pyvips runtime.
Ubuntu users can find this runtime in the apt
package libvips42.

To install the program in Ubuntu in-place, you
can open the terminal at the current location and
run:

chmod +x install
source install

Only this program's folder and '~/.bashrc' will
be altered. The program will be available as
the command 'anime-ultrascale' in any terminal.

The core script 'anime-ultrascale.py' is
self-contained and can be used in any system,
as long as the python packages specified in
"pyproject.toml" are installed.

